     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Rise and shine, Dwellers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Version 1.4 is finally upon you, with a host of exciting new features included:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Your continued support means the world to us, and we hope you'll enjoy this free update which closes out part 1 of our story. It wouldn't have been possible without you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition, we've launched an official Patreon! Using this platform, you can support us, help make the scope of our games larger, and earn cool rewards. Everything we earn on there goes toward game development!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you from the bottom of our hearts for playing our games and enjoying them. You make us feel like there's a place in the world for our unique vision, and we appreciate you all so, so much for that!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have a Guide-tastic weekend!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "/The Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
